      "text": "Since the first replacement was done in May, which has 31 days, then we can repeat the cycle in January, June, November, January, June, November and so on.\n\nWe need to do 24 cycle then add one more time to reach 25 times,\n\n24 quarters = 3 years\n3 + 5 = 8\nThus the answer is 8th Month, which is ____.\n\nThe calculator batteries were replaced 25 times in the month of ____.\n\nComplete the square for the following quadratic: $-11 x^2+2 x-6$\nTo complete the square for the quadratic expression $-11 x^2 + 2 x - 6$, we will follow these steps:\n\n1. **Factor out the coefficient of \\(x^2\\) from the first two terms:**\n   \\[\n   -11 x^2 + 2 x - 6 = -11 (x^2 - \\frac{2}{11} x) - 6\n   \\]\n\n2. **Find the value to complete the square inside the parentheses:**\n   To complete the square for \\(x^2 - \\frac{2}{11} x\\), we take half of the coefficient of \\(x\\), which is \\(\\frac{2}{11}\\), and then square it:\n   \\[\n   \\left(\\frac{2}{11} \\div 2\\right)^2 = \\left(\\frac{1}{11}\\right)^2 = \\frac{1}{121}\n   \\]\n\n3. **Add and subtract this value inside the parentheses:**\n   \\[\n   -11 \\left(x^2 - \\frac{2}{11} x + \\frac{1}{121} - \\frac{1}{121}\\right) - 6\n   \\]\n   This can be rewritten as:\n   \\[\n   -11 \\left(x^2 - \\frac{2}{11} x + \\frac{1}{121}\\right) + \\frac{11}{121} - 6\n   \\]\n\n4. **Simplify the expression inside the parentheses:**\n   The expression inside the parentheses is now a perfect square trinomial:\n   \\[\n   -11 \\left(x - \\frac{1}{11}\\right)^2 + \\frac{11}{121} - 6\n   \\]\n\n5. **Combine the constant terms outside the parentheses:**\n   Convert 6 to a fraction with a denominator of 121:\n   \\[\n   6 = \\frac{726}{121}\n   \\]\n   Now, subtract \\(\\frac{11}{121}\\) from \\(\\frac{726}{121}\\):\n   \\[\n   \\frac{726}{121} - \\frac{11}{121} = \\frac{715}{121}\n   \\]\n\n6. **Write the final completed square form:**\n   \\[\n   -11 \\left(x - \\frac{1}{11}\\right)^2 + \\frac{715}{121}\n   \\]\n\nThus, the completed square form of the quadratic expression is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{-11 \\left(x - \\frac{1}{11}\\right)^2 + \\frac{715}{121}}\n\\]",
